        ("In the above 4 cm painted cube, how many smaller 1 cm cubes have NO painted faces (zero painted)?", {"A": "8", "B": "16", "C": "4", "D": "1"}, "A", "Zero painted faces form the internal core: formula = (n - 2)^3 = (4 - 2)^3 = 2^3 = 8 cubes."),
