        ("How many smaller cubes have exactly ONE painted face?", {"A": "24", "B": "16", "C": "32", "D": "12"}, "A", "One painted face occurs on the faces: formula = 6 * (n - 2)^2 = 6 * (4 - 2)^2 = 6 * 4 = 24 cubes."),
