        ("If a dice is rolled, what is the probability of rolling a composite number?", {"A": "1/3", "B": "1/2", "C": "2/3", "D": "1/6"}, "A", "Faces are {1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6}. Composite numbers are 4 and 6 (2 outcomes). Probability = 2/6 = 1/3."),
